<title>USA: AnnTaylor names Patricia DeRosa president.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor names Patricia DeRosa president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>AnnTaylor Stores Corp said on Monday that it named Patricia DeRosa as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>DeRosa, who was most recently executive vice president of Charming Shoppes Inc, is expected to join the company on December 9, 1996, AnnTaylor said.</p>
<p>DeRosa succeeds J. Patrick Spainhour, who will continue as chairman and chief executive officer, AnnTaylor said.</p>
</text>
